Title: The MBESS R Package
Version: 5.0.0
Date: 2026-06-01
Authors@R: c(person("Ken", "Kelley", role=c("aut", "cre"), email="kkelley@nd.edu"))
Maintainer: Ken Kelley <kkelley@nd.edu>
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0), stats
